### WebSockets can't be tested with plain HTTP requests.
### To try this chapter:
###
### 1. Start the app:  pnpm start:dev
### 2. Open src/examples/websocket/client.html in your browser
###    (open it in two tabs to see messages broadcast between them).
### 3. Type a message and press Send — it appears in every connected tab.
###
### Under the hood the browser connects to the socket.io endpoint at:
###   ws://localhost:3000/socket.io/
